{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主呼召以赛亚作先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当乌西雅王崩的那年，我见主坐在高高的宝座上。他的衣裳垂下，遮满圣殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["其上有撒拉弗侍立，各有六个翅膀：用两个翅膀遮脸，两个翅膀遮脚，两个翅膀飞翔；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["彼此呼喊说：",{"text":"圣哉！圣哉！圣哉！万军之耶和华；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的荣光充满全地！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因呼喊者的声音，门槛的根基震动，殿充满了烟云。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["那时我说：「祸哉！我灭亡了！因为我是嘴唇不洁的人，又住在嘴唇不洁的民中，又因我眼见大君王—万军之耶和华。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["有一撒拉弗飞到我跟前，手里拿着红炭，是用火剪从坛上取下来的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["将炭沾我的口，说：「看哪，这炭沾了你的嘴，你的罪孽便除掉，你的罪恶就赦免了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我又听见主的声音说：「我可以差遣谁呢？谁肯为我们去呢？」我说：「我在这里，请差遣我！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他说：「你去告诉这百姓说：",{"text":"你们听是要听见，却不明白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看是要看见，却不晓得。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使这百姓心蒙脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵发沉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眼睛昏迷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕眼睛看见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵听见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心里明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回转过来，便得医治。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我就说：「主啊，这到几时为止呢？」他说：",{"text":"直到城邑荒凉，无人居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房屋空闲无人，地土极其荒凉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且耶和华将人迁到远方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在这境内撇下的地土很多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境内剩下的人若还有十分之一，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必被吞灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像栗树、橡树虽被砍伐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"树ⶍ子却仍存留。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这圣洁的种类在国中也是如此。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}